      "title": "Lord Hiram Creed",
      "pageid": 329089,
      "revid": 6609795,
      "text": {
        "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox darktable\" cellspacing=\"3\" style=\"border-spacing:3px;width:22em;width:21.5em;\"><tbody><tr class=\"above-header\"><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:125%;font-weight:bold;padding:5px;\"><span style=\"display:table;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;\"><span style=\"display:table-row;\"><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:5px;width:1px;\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mob\" title=\"Mob\"><img alt=\"Mob\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Combat 32.png\" data-image-key=\"Combat_32.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/c/c1/Combat_32.png/revision/latest?cb=20151213203709\" /></a></span></span></span><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:2px;\">Hiram Creed</span></span></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/f/f0/Creed.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230208213556\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Image of Hiram Creed\"><img alt=\"Image of Hiram Creed\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"276\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Creed.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Creed.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/f/f0/Creed.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20230208213556\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Title</th><td>\n&lt;Warlord of the Blackhowl&gt;</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Gender</th><td>\nMale</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Race</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Drakonid\" title=\"Drakonid\">Drakonid</a>&#160;(Dragonkin)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Level</th><td>\n35 Elite</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Resource</th><td>\n<span class=\"cc-shaman\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mana_(game_resource)\" title=\"Mana (game resource)\">Mana</a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Reaction</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Alliance\" title=\"Alliance\"><span class=\"rep-hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Alliance</span></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Horde\" title=\"Horde\"><span class=\"rep-hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Horde</span></a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Affiliation(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Blackhowl\" title=\"Blackhowl\">Blackhowl</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Black_dragonflight\" title=\"Black dragonflight\">Black dragonflight</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Gods%27_forces\" title=\"Old Gods&#39; forces\">Old Gods' forces</a> (de facto)<br /> Supposedly: <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(kingdom)\" title=\"Gilneas (kingdom)\">Gilneas</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Alliance\" title=\"Alliance\">Alliance</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Location</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Stoneward_Prison\" title=\"Stoneward Prison\">Stoneward Prison</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_City\" title=\"Gilneas City\">Gilneas City</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ruins_of_Gilneas\" title=\"Ruins of Gilneas\">Ruins of Gilneas</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Status</th><td>\nDeceased (lore),<br /> Killable <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Cataclysm\" title=\"Cataclysm\"><img alt=\"Cataclysm\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-image-key=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/e/ef/Cata-Logo-Small.png/revision/latest?cb=20120818171714\" /></a></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Lord Hiram Creed</b> was a <a href=\"/wiki/Black_dragonflight\" title=\"Black dragonflight\">black</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Drakonid\" title=\"Drakonid\">drakonid</a> who disguises themselves as an affluent <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(kingdom)\" title=\"Gilneas (kingdom)\">Gilnean</a> noble. Creed manipulated a group of Gilnean humans and worgen named the <a href=\"/wiki/Blackhowl\" title=\"Blackhowl\">Blackhowl</a> who occupied <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_City\" title=\"Gilneas City\">Gilneas City</a>, and secretly infected them with his own draconic blood, which made them stronger but also unwittingly slowly turned them into his unwilling servants. The Blackhowl had apparently repelled numerous <a href=\"/wiki/Forsaken\" title=\"Forsaken\">Forsaken</a> assaults, as seen in the courtyard of the <a href=\"/wiki/Stoneward_Prison\" title=\"Stoneward Prison\">Stoneward Prison</a> where Creed resided, which was littered with Forsaken corpses. \n</p><p>Black Prince <a href=\"/wiki/Wrathion\" title=\"Wrathion\">Wrathion</a> sent his <a href=\"/wiki/Rogue\" title=\"Rogue\">rogue</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Adventurer\" title=\"Adventurer\">champion</a> who sought to earn his favor to assassinate Creed in his crusade to eliminate all corrupted black dragons on <a href=\"/wiki/Azeroth\" title=\"Azeroth\">Azeroth</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Assassinate&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Assassinate-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> With his death, it is unknown what the fate of the Blackhowl group is.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Abilities\">Abilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span id=\"Ability:Consuming&#95;Darkness\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Spell shadow shadesofdarkness\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Spell shadow shadesofdarkness.png\" data-image-key=\"Spell_shadow_shadesofdarkness.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/1/13/Spell_shadow_shadesofdarkness.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20070113160723\" /></span></span>&#160;<b>Consuming Darkness</b></span>&#160;&#8212;&#160;Hurls a ball of dark energy, inflicting shadow damage and creating a zone of consuming darkness on the ground.</span></li>\n<li><span id=\"Ability:Blackhowl&#39;s&#95;Will\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Spell shadow charm\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Spell shadow charm.png\" data-image-key=\"Spell_shadow_charm.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/1/12/Spell_shadow_charm.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20060930185956\" /></span></span>&#160;<a target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/?spell=109664\"><b>Blackhowl's Will</b></a></span>&#160;&#8212;&#160;Deals 18500 to 21500 Shadow damage and drains all energy.</span></li>\n<li><span id=\"Ability:Blackhowl&#39;s&#95;Rage\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Spell shadow deathsembrace\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Spell shadow deathsembrace.png\" data-image-key=\"Spell_shadow_deathsembrace.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/f/fe/Spell_shadow_deathsembrace.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20080906130649\" /></span></span>&#160;<b>Blackhowl's Rage</b></span>&#160;&#8212;&#160;You have hid from Lord Hiram Creed in battle, sending him into a rage, increasing all damage dealt by 100% for 10 sec.</span></li>\n<li><span id=\"Ability:Shadow&#95;Breath\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Spell fire twilightflamebreath\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Spell fire twilightflamebreath.png\" data-image-key=\"Spell_fire_twilightflamebreath.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/f/fd/Spell_fire_twilightflamebreath.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20101202192226\" /></span></span>&#160;<b>Shadow Breath</b></span>&#160;&#8212;&#160;Deals 13875 to 16125 Shadow damage.</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quotes\">Quotes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/1/13/Hiram_Creed_Drakonid.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150610061933\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hiram Creed in his drakonid form\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"193\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Hiram Creed Drakonid.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hiram_Creed_Drakonid.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/1/13/Hiram_Creed_Drakonid.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20150610061933\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/1/13/Hiram_Creed_Drakonid.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150610061933\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hiram Creed in his drakonid form\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/1/13/Hiram_Creed_Drakonid.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20150610061933\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"193\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Hiram Creed Drakonid.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hiram_Creed_Drakonid.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/1/13/Hiram_Creed_Drakonid.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20150610061933\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Hiram_Creed_Drakonid.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Hiram Creed in his drakonid form</p> \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<dl><dt>Aggro</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"text-say\"><b>Lord Hiram Creed&#160;says:</b> An assassin, eh? Who sent you? Speak, or I will carve the answer from your skull!</span></dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>75% Health</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"text-say\"><b>Lord Hiram Creed&#160;says:</b> I tire of this disguise. Now we finish this!</span></dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>Death</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"text-say\"><b>Lord Hiram Creed&#160;says:</b> Who... ordered... this?</span></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objective_of\">Objective of</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>He is to be killed for the quest <span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"questlong-prefix linkicon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"N\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/c/cb/Neutral_15.png/revision/latest?cb=20110620220434\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Neutral 15.png\" data-image-key=\"Neutral_15.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span>&#160;<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Rogue\"><img alt=\"Rogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Ui-charactercreate-classes rogue.png\" data-image-key=\"Ui-charactercreate-classes_rogue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/b/b1/Ui-charactercreate-classes_rogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20070124144931\" /></span></span>&#160;[35]&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Assassinate_Creed\" title=\"Assassinate Creed\"><span class=\"ajaxttlink questlink\">Assassinate Creed</span></a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Speculation\">Speculation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table style=\"background: transparent;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/2b/Questionmark-medium.png/revision/latest?cb=20061019212216\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Questionmark-medium\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"41\" height=\"55\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Questionmark-medium.png\" data-image-key=\"Questionmark-medium.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/2b/Questionmark-medium.png/revision/latest?cb=20061019212216\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #808080; border-bottom: 1px solid #808080; padding: 1ex 1em; margin-top: 0.3ex; max-width: 34em;\"><small style=\"line-height: 120%;\">This article or section includes speculation, observations or opinions possibly supported by lore or by Blizzard officials. <b>It should not be taken as representing official lore.</b></small></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Wrathion and his followers claimed that the Gilneans had no clue of their subversion, so at the time they might've been fighting for the Alliance. However Creed later turned them all into his loyal servants with his draconic blood, and they were also hostile to Alliance rogues sent to kill Creed. Creed also fought the Forsaken within Gilneas. It thus seems that Creed sought to take Gilneas for himself or his flight, turning its inhabitants into his unwilling servants.\n</p><p>Given that Creed holds enough prestige to lead a force into Gilneas City without question and his affluency was not questioned by his followers, he was likely masquerading as a nobleman for a long time to build up that trust, or he has impersonated an actual nobleman.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Patch_changes\">Patch changes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 50px; text-align:center\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Cataclysm\" title=\"Cataclysm\"><img alt=\"Cataclysm\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-image-key=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/e/ef/Cata-Logo-Small.png/revision/latest?cb=20120818171714\" /></a></span></span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Patch_4.3.0\" title=\"Patch 4.3.0\">Patch 4.3.0</a> (2011-11-29):</b> Added.   <i></i><br /></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:calc(80% + 2.1px);\"><div style=\"margin-top:-0.3em; margin-bottom:0px; height:0px\">&#160;</div><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Assassinate-1\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-Assassinate_1-0\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"questlong-prefix linkicon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"N\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/c/cb/Neutral_15.png/revision/latest?cb=20110620220434\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Neutral 15.png\" data-image-key=\"Neutral_15.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span>&#160;<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Rogue\"><img alt=\"Rogue\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/b/b1/Ui-charactercreate-classes_rogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20070124144931\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Ui-charactercreate-classes rogue.png\" data-image-key=\"Ui-charactercreate-classes_rogue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span>&#160;[35]&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Assassinate_Creed\" title=\"Assassinate Creed\"><span class=\"ajaxttlink questlink\">Assassinate Creed</span></a></span></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul class=\"elinks\">\n<li class=\"wowhead\"><a target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/npc=57802\">Wowhead</a></li>\n<li class=\"sigrie\"><a target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.wowdb.com/npcs/57802\">WoWDB</a></li>\n\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261114172716\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.087 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.116 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1144/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15463/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3084/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/100\nExpensive parser function count: 5/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1280/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 647391/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   67.921      1 -total\n 59.01%   40.080      1 Template:Npcbox\n 52.82%   35.874      1 Template:Infobox\n 11.10%    7.538      1 Template:Reflist\n  9.40%    6.387      4 Template:Abilities\n  8.07%    5.478      1 Template:Level\n  6.10%    4.146      1 Template:Patch_4.3.0\n  5.48%    3.724      1 Template:Elinks-NPC\n  4.80%    3.262      4 Template:Nowrap\n  4.70%    3.190      1 Template:Aggro\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_wowpedia:pcache:idhash:329089-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timesta